  "We may retain certain information where required for:": "தேவைப்படும் இடங்களில் சில information retain செய்வோம்:",
  "We implement commercially reasonable safeguards to help protect information, including:": "information பாதுகாக்க commercially reasonable safeguards-ஐ implement செய்கிறோம், including:",
  "However, no method of internet transmission or electronic storage is completely secure.": "internet transmission/electronic storage முறை completely secure அல்ல.",
  "Accordingly, we cannot guarantee absolute security of information.": "எனவே, information-ன் absolute security-க்கு guarantee அளிக்க முடியாது.",
  "The Platform may integrate with or contain links to third-party services, tools or websites.": "Platform third-party services, tools/websites links-ஐ integrate/contain செய்யலாம்.",
  "Users should review the privacy policies of external services separately.": "external services-ன் privacy policies-ஐ users த separately review செய்ய வேண்டும்.",
  "Users acknowledge and agree that:": "users acknowledge/ agree:",
  "While Quanta Loop takes reasonable measures to protect information, we do not guarantee absolute protection against unauthorised access, hacking, data loss or security breaches.": "Quanta Loop reasonable measures எடுத்தாலும், unauthorised access, hacking, data loss/security breaches-க்கு absolute protection guarantee இல்லை.",
  "The Platform is intended only for business and professional users who are at least 18 years of age.": "Platform குறைந்தது 18 years age உடைய business/professional users-க்கு மட்டும்.",
  "Quanta Loop does not knowingly collect personal information from children.": "Quanta Loop knowingly children-இலிருந்து personal information collect செய்யாது.",
  "We may update or modify this Privacy Policy from time to time.": "இந்த Privacy Policy-ஐ time to time update/modify செய்யலாம்.",
